[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><p>1. Undo the bolt (1a) and remove the sliding contacts support (1b) from its housing in the bodyshell.</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connectors and remove the support.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Rear left door connection</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223004629\">See D35 REAR/LEFT REAR DOOR COUPLING</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Rear right door connection</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223004633\">See D36 REAR/RIGHT REAR DOOR COUPLING</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223002869.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Rear left door connection</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223004629\">See D35 REAR/LEFT REAR DOOR COUPLING</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Rear right door connection</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223004633\">See D36 REAR/RIGHT REAR DOOR COUPLING</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Place the sliding contact support in position and secure it using the bolt.</p>"]]